# Copy to .env and fill in only if you're testing against a backend that has
# ORCA_API_KEY set (backend/.env.example, backend/auth.py). Leave unset for
# normal local dev against the default zero-auth backend — every /api/*
# fetch works exactly as before either way (frontend/src/lib/apiFetch.ts).
# Must match the backend's ORCA_API_KEY exactly.
# VITE_ORCA_API_KEY=your-long-random-secret-here
